      "content": "Hey, I just sent over the FluxCore due diligence folder. I've known the founders for years and I'm really leaning towards a big follow-on investment here. Their pitch deck makes a massive case for 'exponential user growth'—can you look at the raw user acquisition files and tell me if the data actually supports that narrative?",
