      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "We can certainly reframe the narrative to focus on the *quality* of the growth, rather than just the raw velocity. Instead of \"plateau,\" we can present this as a successful maturation phase where user retention rates are significantly higher than industry benchmarks. This suggests a very sticky product, which is a far more valuable long-term indicator than a brief burst of acquisition. I'll draft a talking point sheet emphasizing this shift in user lifecycle value for the committee.",
